LL(1) gramatika pre jazyk IFJ25
Štartovací symbol: Program

=== Povinný Prolog a kostra programu ===
Program -> Prolog TOKEN_NEW_LINE Main_class TOKEN_EOF
Prolog -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_IMPORT TOKEN_STRING("ifj25") TOKEN_KEYWORD_FOR TOKEN_KEYWORD_IFJ
Main_class -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_CLASS TOKEN_IDENTIFIER(Program) TOKEN_BLOCK_START TOKEN_NEW_LINE Main_class_block TOKEN_BLOCK_END TOKEN_NEW_LINE
Main_class_block -> Func_dec Main_class_block | eps

=== Všeobecný block a jeho obsah ===
Block -> TOKEN_BLOCK_START Block_content TOKEN_BLOCK_END TOKEN_NEW_LINE
Block_content -> TOKEN_NEW_LINE smth | Oneline_expr_opt 

smth -> smth_list smth_tail
smth_tail -> TOKEN_NEW_LINE smth | eps 
smth_list ->  Return | Var | If | While | For | Break | Continue | Call_assign | Global_assign | eps 
Oneline_expr_opt -> Expr | eps

=== Funkcie, Getter a Setter === 
Func_dec -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_STATIC TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Func_dec_tail
Func_dec_tail -> TOKEN_LPAREN Param TOKEN_RPAREN Block | TOKEN_ASSIGN TOKEN_LPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_RPAREN Block | Block
Param -> TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Param_list | eps
Param_list -> TOKEN_COMMA TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Param_list | eps 
Func_call -> TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_LPAREN Var_arg TOKEN_RPAREN | TOKEN_KEYWORD_IFJ TOKEN_DOT TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_LPAREN Var_arg TOKEN_RPAREN

=== Deklarovanie výrazu ===
Var -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_VAR TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Var_EXT
Var_EXT -> TOKEN_ASSIGN Expr | eps 
Var_arg -> Expr var_arg_list | eps
var_arg_list -> TOKEN_COMMA Expr var_arg_list | eps 

=== Všeobecné priradnie ====
Call_assign -> TOKEN_IDENTIFIER Call_assign_list
Call_assign_list -> TOKEN_ASSIGN Expr | TOKEN_LPAREN Var_arg TOKEN_RPAREN   
Global_assign -> TOKEN_GLOBAL_ID TOKEN_ASSIGN Expr 
 
=== if else podmienky ===
If -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_IF TOKEN_LPAREN Expr TOKEN_RPAREN Block Else 
Else ->  TOKEN_KEYWORD_ELSE Block | TOKEN_KEYWORD_ELSE If | eps

=== Cykly For a While === 
While -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_WHILE TOKEN_LPAREN Expr TOKEN_RPAREN Block
For -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_FOR TOKEN_LPAREN TOKEN_IDENTIFIER TOKEN_KEYWORD_IN Expr TOKEN_RPAREN Block
Break -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_BREAK
Continue -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_CONTINUE

=== Return pre EXTSTAT === 
Return -> TOKEN_KEYWORD_RETURN Return_expr
Return_expr -> Expr | eps


=== Výrazy ===
Expr -> /* precedenčná analýza */



 
